# Legacy and guessable short URLs → canonical pages, 301 so accumulated
# authority lands on the surviving page instead of a 404. The list lives in
# src/data/redirects.json; postbuild expands the marker below.
# @redirects

# Anything unmatched gets the real 404 page with a real 404 status.
# Without this a static host may fall back to index.html, which serves the
# homepage at every bad URL — a soft 404, and infinite duplicate content.
/*        /404.html                        404
